Sets a key with a literal string value on a plan that already has frontmatter.

-- fixtures/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
---
# My Plan

Some body text here.
-- cmd --
booping frontmatter-update plan.md status=in-progress
-- exit --
0
-- stdout --
--- plan.md
+++ plan.md
@@ -1,5 +1,6 @@
 ---
 title: My Plan
+status: in-progress
 ---
 # My Plan
 
-- stderr --
updated plan.md: status=in-progress
-- expected/cwd/plan.md --
---
title: My Plan
status: in-progress
---
# My Plan

Some body text here.
